-others are untested.
+`tests/test_session.py` checks vectors 1–8, 10 and 12, and vector 9 typed raw,
+automatically against a real bash (5.3.9 on Ubuntu 26.04). Vectors 11 and 13–16 need
+terminal ownership (§6) or session recovery (§4.4) and are not tested yet.
 
